DestDataSize|Destination data size|||||
DataAlignment|Data alignment|||||
BufferTransferLength|Buffer transfer length|||1|128|
SourceBurst|Source burst|||||
DestBurst|Destination burst|||||
SourceBlockAddressOffset|Source block address offset|||-65535|65535|
DestBlockAddressOffset|Destination block address offset|||-65535|65535|
MaskAddress|Mask address|||0|4294967295|
MaskData|Mask data|||0|4294967295|
SrcAddress|Src Memory Address for the Node, example:'(uint32_t)&amp;my_address[0]'or '0x12345678')|||0|4294967295|
DstAddress|Dest Memory Address for the Node , example:'(uint32_t)&amp;my_address[0]'or '0x12345678')|||0|4294967295|
BlockDataLength|Data length of a block in byte|||0|65536|
BlockCount|Block Counter (number of blocks to be transfered)|||0|4096|
